    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>The preview version of Event Hubs is now available on Azure Stack Hub. This will allow you to realize cloud and on-premises scenarios that use streaming and event-based architectures.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/event-hubs-blog/introducing-preview-version-of-event-hubs-on-azure-stack-hub/ba-p/1269751\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/event-hubs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read the Event Hubs documentation</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "The preview version of Event Hubs is now available on Azure Stack Hub. This will allow you to realize cloud and on-premises scenarios that use streaming and event-based architectures.\n\nLearn more .\n\nRead the Event Hubs documentation ."
  },
